# Compact Usage Report Analysis Prompt

## TASK
Analyze usage report sub-issues #17-22 to identify NEW Quick Note button patterns.

## CRITICAL EXCLUSIONS - Do NOT Recommend These Existing Buttons:

### System Login:
- Logged into [System] (Novar/Opus Arch/Opus Mag/CPC/AKA65/Storeview)
- Did not login to an EMS

### Diagnostics (All Categories):
- Checked comms (success/failure)
- Pinged controller, Good ping, Ping Timed Out (post-comm loss only)
- Checked temps/alarms/clocks/Module Comms
- Tested [component], Check breakers, Staging, Defrost actions
- Pressures (SUCT PSI/DISC PSI), Receiver level (refrigeration)

### Actions (All Categories):  
- Forced on [equipment], Forced [parameter], Forced off [item]
- RTU Setpoint, Rack/Case Settings, Shutdown circuit
- Lighting schedule, Reset clocks, Terminated Defrost

### Downloads (Novar):
- All download combinations (Version/Load Change/Comms/Main/Full)

### Status & Communication:
- All good/No good, Tech T/S, Call Done/Dropped
- Advisory, Tech asked/refused, Status update (all prompt-based)
- Monitor advice, Contact advice, Replace advice
- PCR/PDR submission, Escalate

### Special Cases:
- Power cycle controller, Remodel, Sams store, Sporlan restart
- Not onsite defrost denial, NSRM suppression

## ANALYSIS REQUIREMENTS

1. **Read complete notes** (not previews) from Issues #17-22
2. **Document patterns** with exact quotes + citations
3. **Minimum 3 occurrences** across different notes  
4. **Exclude semantic duplicates**:
   - "Called tech" = existing Communication
   - "Verified temps" = "Checked temps"  
   - "Reset controller" = "Power cycle controller"
   - "Forced compressor on" = "Forced [parameter]" prompt

## OUTPUT FORMAT

### Section 1: Excluded Patterns
List what you found but excluded and why (which existing button covers it)

### Section 2: Prompt Button Usage Opportunities  
Document how often existing prompt buttons could have covered found patterns

### Section 3: NEW Recommendations Only
Only patterns NOT covered by existing buttons or prompts:
- **Button Name:** [Text]
- **Frequency:** X notes
- **Citations:** Issue #X, Note Y, WO: Z, Quote: "exact text"
- **Category:** [Type]

## KEY REMINDERS
- If it could be typed into an existing PROMPT button → NOT new
- 80+ existing buttons cover most patterns → focus on genuinely novel actions
- Ping buttons are dynamic (only visible after comm loss)
- Many buttons are system-dependent (Clocks, Sporlan, etc.)
- Prompt buttons cover wide ranges (Forced [X], Tested [Y], Advisory [Z])

**FINAL CHECK:** Every recommendation must be a pattern NOT covered by existing functionality.